      "title": "pi-H3 settings",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "pi-H3 on the native MiniMax H3 model (sampled like a plain flow model, any ComfyUI sampler).\n\nLoad LakonLab Adapter: pi_h3_{2,4}step_adapter or pi_h3_{2,4}step_dwd_adapter.\npi-Flow Scheduler: steps = the adapter's step count, max_raw_t 0.93 (2-step) / 0.96 (4-step),\n  final_step_size_scale 0.6, min_raw_t 0. The video/audio shifts (default 12 / 3) are set by\n  ModelSamplingMiniMaxH3, whose model feeds both the scheduler and the guider.\n\nDWD adapters: DWD Decode gives the video pixels (connect the sampler's 'output', not 'denoised_output').\nNon-DWD adapters: replace DWD Decode with VAE Decode (video VAE) on the sampler output.\n\nLoRAs go before Load LakonLab Adapter (enable the bypassed node). Earlier LoRA patches on the\nweights the adapter replaces are dropped."
